{"content":[{"c":["HAROSHETH-HAGGOYIM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Town in Canaan that was the home of Sisera. This Canaanite general led his forces from Harosheth against Deborah and Barak (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.4.2-13","r":"Judg.4.2-13","rawR":"Judg.4.2-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.4.2-13","value":"Judg.4.2-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 4:2-13"},", ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Harosheth of the Gentiles”). After his soldiers panicked, they fled back to Harosheth where they were defeated (v ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.4.16","r":"Judg.4.16","rawR":"Judg.4.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.4.16","value":"Judg.4.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"16"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"HaroshethHaggoyim","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jgs 4:2-13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.4.2-13","rawQueryValue":"Judg.4.2-13","sourceRefExact":"Judg.4.2-13"},{"anchorText":"16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.4.16","rawQueryValue":"Judg.4.16","sourceRefExact":"Judg.4.16"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"41a6281df6ae6025443245399578757e663b8d3620217b2dc02033849308d07c","sourceItemName":"HaroshethHaggoyim","sourceItemOrder":126,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"HaroshethHaggoyim","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Harosheth-Haggoyim","title":"Harosheth-Haggoyim","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}